# 4. GitOps and Release Dashboard

## Objective
Manage Kubernetes deployment configuration through Helm and Argo CD GitOps.

## Flow
1.GitHub -> Actions -> 01-Preflight -> Argo CD is being created and it connects with GCP
2.GitHub -> Actions -> 02-Build and Push DEV -> Image tag valid: v1.1.0 (example vx.x.x) GitHub Actions successfully built and pushed images to GCP Registry

